    "title": "Smorzo",
    "coverImage": "/uploads/2021/11/WhatsApp-Image-2021-11-09-at-14.46.24.png",
    "content": "<p><em>10 luglio 2021</em></p>\n\n\n\n<p>In un’ambientazione industriale come quella di uno Smorzo, sono stati introdotti gli interventi site specific di Paolo Di Noto, Tonino Pepe, Filippo Cocca, Nawezito e Alexander Benigni.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Ha dato il via all’evento la sfilata di presentazione dei capi degli studenti e studentesse dell’Accademia Costume e Moda di Roma.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Dj set di Antonio Vicario, Sandra Mason e Tiago Felicetti.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-video\"><!-- VIDEO ESCLUSO (file pesante, reinserire in public/uploads): /uploads/2021/11/SFILATA-SMORZO-HD-1080p.mov --></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/uploads/2021/11/insta-9-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-777\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/uploads/2021/11/insta-7-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-778\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/uploads/2021/11/insta-8-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-779\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/uploads/2021/11/insta-10-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-780\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/uploads/2021/11/insta-4-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-781\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/uploads/2021/11/insta-1-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-782\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n<!-- wp:post-featured-image /-->"
