    "title": "Instant Paper",
    "coverImage": "/uploads/2021/07/erno-1-.jpg",
    "content": "<p><em>4 settembre 2019</em></p>\n\n\n\n<p>In collaborazione con l’edicola Erno, Edicola Romana Non Ordinaria. Erno si occupa di magazine e libri d’arte, moda, design e architettura.<br>Prendendo l'edicola come punto di riferimento, la mostra si è sviluppata nello spazio circostante. Esposizione di magazine di giovani creativi e installazioni site specific.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/uploads/2021/07/erno-5.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-562\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:100%\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/uploads/2021/07/erno-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-559\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/uploads/2021/07/erno-1-.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-558\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/uploads/2021/07/erno-3-.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-560\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/uploads/2021/07/erno-6.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-563\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/uploads/2021/07/erno-7.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-564\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src